{
  "name": "ParserBee: Google Drive invoices to Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Google Drive invoices to Google Sheets\n\nEvery new PDF or image in a Drive folder is sent to ParserBee, and the extracted invoice lines are added to a Google Sheet.\n\n1. Pick the folder in **New file in folder**.\n2. Create a **Header Auth** credential named *ParserBee API key*: name `x-api-key`, value your API key.\n3. Paste your Parser Template ID in **ParserBee: extract data**.\n4. Pick the spreadsheet in **Add rows to sheet**, then activate the workflow.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "65057030-fec9-5f33-bf38-bd8b93b8d15b",
      "name": "Read me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
